node_modules/
.env
*.local
dist/
.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
# NOTE: data/seen.json is intentionally NOT ignored — it is the committed
# dedup state that lets the bot remember what it already alerted on.
#
# Same goes for data/pursuit.json: your triage decisions have to reach CI, or
# the weekly digest cannot know what you already skipped.
#
# data/snapshot.json IS ignored: it is derived from a run, it is megabytes, and
# only the local dashboard reads it. Regenerate with `npm run dry`.
data/snapshot.json

# Exported dashboards are shareable point-in-time copies of the same data, so
# they do not belong in the repo either. Regenerate with `npm run dashboard:export`.
dashboard-export/
